menu "libmoy"

config MOY_WITH_LUA
    bool "Build the Lua binding"
    default y
    help
      Compile src/moy_lua.c and the vendored Lua 5.4 (already configured with
      LUA_32BITS, which moy SPEC.md 4.2 requires). Turn this off if your host
      drives the console from C, or if you are supplying your own lua_State --
      libmoy binds to whichever you hand it.

      Costs about 140 KB of flash on esp32p4 and 122 KB on esp32s3 -- measured,
      by building example/esp-idf both ways at -Og. Optimising for size moves
      both down.

endmenu
